  "Id": "361188e3-9476-5358-b69e-e61310c86696"/*VolumeFireSmokeExample*/,
  "Description": "Fire with smoke from a sparse volume: three stacked spheres union into a tapering plume, [VolumeNoise] sculpts it with turbulence, and [VolumeToPoints] scatters the surface into particles that two [DrawBillboards] layers draw - a small hot core and a wide grey haze around the same points.",
